---
import { localePath, type Locale } from '../../i18n';
import ExternalBrandMark from '../common/ExternalBrandMark';
interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);
const briefingHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/briefing/');
const h17 = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/blob/b3091ed70f060742147e931b8533784c8dfe1745/docs/science/webshop/runs/2026-08-15/h1.17-horizon-interface-diagnostic.md';
const q17 = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/378';
const direct = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/404';
const final7 = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/291';
const final17 = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/blob/main/docs/evidence/server-runs/2026-09-06/qwen3-1p7b-final-closeout/FINAL_ANALYSIS.json';
const wandb7 = 'https://wandb.ai/zju-openevo-wangrui/zju-openevo-experiments/runs/ceiling1-stage2-7b-202609041833-b01d24a468';
const wandb17 = 'https://wandb.ai/zju-openevo-wangrui/zju-openevo-experiments/runs/ceiling1-stage2-qwen3-1p7b-202609041833-4c1bb58e9f';
const taskVectorPr358 = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/358';
const parameterMeasurementPr317 = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/317';
---

<article class="technical-notes" data-ui-audit="surface">
  <header class="technical-intro">
    <a class="back-link" href={briefingHref}>← {t('返回暑期考核汇报', 'Back to summer review')}</a>
    <h1>{t('技术推导与实验严谨性', 'Technical derivations and experimental rigor')}</h1>
    <p>{t('主汇报只保留会改变科研判断的结论。这里展开完整推导、负向实验、对照定义和复现边界，方便感兴趣的读者继续追证据。', 'The main talk keeps only conclusions that change the research judgment. This page expands the derivations, negative experiments, comparison definitions, and reproducibility boundaries for readers who want the full evidence.')}</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>{t('0. 早期控制条件如何误挡长期训练，以及 7B 后来实际更新了什么', '0. How an early control condition blocked long-run training, and what the later 7B run updated')}</h2>
    <h3>{t('为什么 7-vs-8 会出错', 'Why 7-vs-8 failed')}</h3>
    <p>{t('早期 LoRA / SD-LoRA 方法对照里，8 个任务身份 × 每个 2 条成功用于构造共享成功数据集。它服务于“公平比较训练方法”；长期学习算法不应沿用这个门槛。旧 Stage 2 后来把这个 control 条件误带进长期 selector：每 256 rollout 必须达到 8 个 qualifying identities 才允许参数更新。实际窗口最多只有 7 个，于是 20,480 rollout、797 qualified-positive trajectories、80 / 80 blocks 仍然得到 0 parameter updates。', 'In the early LoRA / SD-LoRA method comparison, 8 task identities × 2 successes each constructed the shared success dataset. It served a fair training-method comparison; the long-term OpenEVO learning algorithm should not inherit that threshold. The old Stage 2 later leaked that control condition into the long-run selector: a 256-rollout window needed 8 qualifying identities before a parameter update was allowed. A real window topped out at 7, so 20,480 rollouts, 797 qualified-positive trajectories, and 80 / 80 blocks still yielded 0 parameter updates.')}</p>
    <p>{t('修正后的 Stage 2 明确禁止 old 7-vs-8、16-success gate 和 256-rollout parametric cadence，改成 round-local：每轮 128 次环境尝试，只要至少一个 clean exact-success task，就允许一次 SD-LoRA 更新机会；0 success 则记录为 NOOP。', 'The corrected Stage 2 explicitly forbids the old 7-vs-8 gate, the 16-success gate, and the 256-rollout parametric cadence. It is round-local: each round has 128 environment attempts; at least one clean exact-success task allows one SD-LoRA update opportunity; zero success is recorded as NOOP.')}</p>
    <h3>{t('7B 长跑最终更新成什么', 'What the 7B long run updated into')}</h3>
    <p>{t('最早 7B Stage 1 只收集原始 WebShop 轨迹，不注入 Memory / Skill / Agent / SD adapter。后来跑到 49.33 的 Ceiling-1.0 7B，实际使用的状态包含 Text Memory、Skill Bundle、Agent System 和累计 SD-LoRA 参数状态。最终评测时，这些非参数状态与累计写入 143 次更新后形成的 SD-LoRA 参数状态共同定义模型输入与参数状态；这里不把“最终状态包含某个载体”扩大成“每个载体每轮都发生更新”。', 'The earliest 7B Stage 1 only collected raw WebShop trajectories and did not inject Memory / Skill / Agent / SD adapter. In the later Ceiling-1.0 7B run that ended at 49.33, the active state included Text Memory, Skill Bundle, Agent System, and the cumulative SD-LoRA parameter state. At final evaluation, those non-parametric states and the cumulative SD-LoRA state produced after 143 written updates jointly defined the model input and parameter state; carrier presence in the final state does not imply that every carrier mutated in every round.')}</p>
    <h3>{t('64-component 上限怎么放', 'Where the 64-component limit belongs')}</h3>
    <p>{t('64-component 是后续大量更新以后暴露的工程容量限制。主演讲只保留它的科研含义：64 没有构成能力上限；解开工程 guard 后，7B 才能继续累计到 64 次以上更新。child-runtime 与 51→52 资格验证细节属于技术审计，不应占主叙事。', 'The 64-component limit was an engineering capacity limit exposed only after many updates. The main talk keeps only its research meaning: 64 did not define the capability ceiling; after removing the engineering guard, the 7B run could continue beyond 64 updates. Child-runtime and 51→52 qualification details belong to the technical audit, not the main narrative.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>{t('1. 训练过程曲线：什么能画，什么不能混在一起', '1. Training dynamics: what can be plotted and what must stay separate')}</h2>
    <h3>{t('7B 记录：149 轮训练曲线与冻结终评是两层证据', '7B record: the 149-round training curve and frozen final are different evidence layers')}</h3>
    <p>{t('7B 主线使用 canonical W&B run `ceiling1-stage2-7b-202609041833-b01d24a468`。它保留 R0–R148 共 149 个训练 round 的 WebShop Score，以及 143 次真正写入后续模型的 SD-LoRA 更新 loss。前 20 轮平均 Score 为 13.42，最后 20 轮为 65.02；更新 loss 从 0.666 降到 0.028。这个 run 的 Stage2 身份与最终发布线一致：149 个完成 round、19,072 次 accepted rollout、143 个 SD-LoRA generations。', 'The 7B main line uses canonical W&B run `ceiling1-stage2-7b-202609041833-b01d24a468`. It preserves WebShop Score for all 149 training rounds R0–R148 and loss for 143 SD-LoRA updates actually written into later model states. Mean Score rises from 13.42 over the first 20 rounds to 65.02 over the last 20, while update loss falls from 0.666 to 0.028. The run identity matches the published endpoint: 149 completed rounds, 19,072 accepted rollouts, and 143 SD-LoRA generations.')}</p>
    <div class="evidence-row"><span>{t('训练 Score', 'training Score')}</span><strong>13.42 → 65.02</strong><span>{t('update loss', 'update loss')}</span><strong>0.666 → 0.028</strong><span>{t('冻结终评', 'frozen final')}</span><strong>49.33</strong></div>
    <p>{t('49.33 来自训练完成以后一次性打开的冻结 128 题 final panel；它不能与训练轮次 Score 当成同一条曲线。训练曲线说明“模型确实在训练过程中学到了东西”，终评回答“这些学习能否转化到冻结未参与训练的最终任务”。', 'The 49.33 score comes from the frozen 128-task final panel opened only after training completed. It must not be treated as another point on the training-round Score curve. The training curve answers whether learning occurred during training; the final panel asks whether that learning transfers to held-out final tasks.')}</p>
    <p class="source"><a href={wandb7} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">7B canonical W&B run</a> · <a href={final7} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={final7} /> 7B published final lineage</a></p>

    <h3>{t('1.7B 记录：44 个候选发生过，但 authority loss 只保留了 7 个接纳更新', '1.7B record: 44 candidates occurred, but authoritative loss is retained for only 7 admitted updates')}</h3>
    <p>{t('1.7B canonical W&B run `ceiling1-stage2-qwen3-1p7b-202609041833-4c1bb58e9f` 保留完整 R0–R159 的 160 个训练轮次 Score，也保留 44 个 `candidate_update_attempted` 事件和 7 个 `active_update_accepted` 事件。前 20 轮平均 Score 44.66，最后 20 轮 51.22。', 'The 1.7B canonical W&B run `ceiling1-stage2-qwen3-1p7b-202609041833-4c1bb58e9f` preserves Score for all 160 training rounds R0–R159, plus 44 `candidate_update_attempted` events and 7 `active_update_accepted` events. Mean Score is 44.66 over the first 20 rounds and 51.22 over the last 20.')}</p>
    <p>{t('关键缺口必须如实保留：canonical W&B 只在那 7 个最终被 GDR 接纳的更新行里保留 `update/training_loss`；另外 37 个被拒绝候选缺少可作为 authority 的 loss 字段。7 个可核验 loss 从 1.041 降到 0.196。我们可以画 44 个候选发生位置、7 个接纳位置和这 7 个 loss；避免凭空补一条 44 点 loss 曲线。', 'A key gap must remain explicit: canonical W&B retains `update/training_loss` only on the 7 updates admitted by GDR; the other 37 rejected candidates lack an authoritative loss field. The 7 verifiable losses fall from 1.041 to 0.196. We may plot all 44 candidate locations, the 7 admissions, and these 7 losses; we avoid inventing a 44-point loss curve.')}</p>
    <div class="evidence-row"><span>{t('候选训练', 'candidate attempts')}</span><strong>44</strong><span>{t('GDR 接纳', 'GDR admitted')}</span><strong>7</strong><span>{t('冻结终评', 'frozen final')}</span><strong>37.60</strong></div>
    <p class="source"><a href={wandb17} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">1.7B canonical W&B run</a> · <a href={final17} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={final17} /> 1.7B final analysis</a></p>

    <h3>{t('3B 记录：当前可核验到 R0–R122', '3B record: the currently verified ledger covers R0–R122')}</h3>
    <p>{t('3B 曲线来自服务器 formal-vnext-v1 的 canonical Stage2 metrics ledger。当前覆盖 R0–R122，共 123 个已封存 round、15,744 次正式环境尝试。每个 round 的 WebShop Score 描述当轮 128 次环境交互的行为表现；它和冻结 128 题 final panel 的终评分数属于不同指标。', 'The 3B curve comes from the canonical Stage2 metrics ledger for formal-vnext-v1. It currently covers R0–R122: 123 sealed rounds and 15,744 formal environment attempts. WebShop Score at each round describes the 128 environment interactions in that round; it is not the frozen 128-task final-panel score.')}</p>
    <p>{t('SD-LoRA training loss 也只在部分轮次出现：只有真正训练出候选更新的 round 才有 loss 点。当前 ledger 中有 31 个候选训练 loss 点；图上避免把 NOOP round 补成 0，也避免把候选训练次数与真正进入 active model 的参数更新次数混为一谈。', 'SD-LoRA training loss exists only on selected rounds: a loss point exists only when a candidate update is actually trained. The current ledger has 31 candidate-training loss points; NOOP rounds must not be filled with zero, and candidate-training count must not be confused with updates actually admitted to the active model.')}</p>
    <div class="evidence-row"><span>{t('前20轮平均 Score', 'first-20 mean Score')}</span><strong>2.69</strong><span>{t('后23轮平均 Score', 'last-23 mean Score')}</span><strong>14.67</strong><span>{t('candidate loss', 'candidate loss')}</span><strong>1.78 → 1.03</strong></div>
    <p>{t('这 15,744 次尝试里，ledger 记录的 engineering invalid、parser repair、invalid-action termination 都是 0。这只能排除已经观测到的这些简单工程故障解释，不能证明系统不存在任何工程误差。', 'Across these 15,744 attempts, the ledger records zero engineering-invalid, parser-repair, and invalid-action-termination events. This rules out those observed simple engineering-failure explanations; it does not prove that every possible engineering error is absent.')}</p>
    <aside><strong>{t('如果要画 checkpoint 的“最终得分曲线”', 'If we replay final scores across checkpoints')}</strong><p>{t('应当在训练和 checkpoint 选择全部结束以后，固定若干里程碑 checkpoint，统一回放同一套冻结评测，并明确标成 post-hoc checkpoint replay。回放结果不能反过来用于训练、early stopping 或 checkpoint selection；否则 final panel 就被变成了调参集。', 'Do it only after training and checkpoint selection are complete: freeze milestone checkpoints, replay the same frozen evaluation, and label the result as post-hoc checkpoint replay. Those replay scores must not feed back into training, early stopping, or checkpoint selection, or the final panel becomes a tuning set.')}</p></aside>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>{t('2. 15 步还是 30 步：一次干净的负向实验', '2. 15 or 30 steps: a clean negative experiment')}</h2>
    <p>{t('H1.17 只改变 WebShop 的 max_steps：15 与 30。memory、adapter、prompt、parser 和任务列表全部保持不变。64 条比较中 64 条尝试都有效，两种条件 reward 都是 0，每个配对差值都是 0。', 'H1.17 changed only WebShop max_steps: 15 versus 30. Memory, adapter, prompt, parser, and task identity stayed fixed. All 64 attempts were valid, both conditions had zero reward, and every paired delta was zero.')}</p>
    <div class="evidence-row"><span>15 steps</span><strong>0</strong><span>30 steps</span><strong>0</strong><span>Δ</span><strong>0.0</strong></div>
    <p>{t('因此，“15 步太短”解释不充分。后续应该换科学问题，停止继续在 horizon 上搜索。', 'Therefore “15 steps is too short” is insufficient. The next move is a new scientific question, with horizon search stopped.')}</p>
    <p class="source"><a href={h17} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={h17} /> H1.17 evidence</a></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>{t('3. Text Memory：2048 → 4096 为什么仍然不够', '3. Text Memory: why 2048 → 4096 was still insufficient')}</h2>
    <p>{t('这里的 2048 / 4096 是 Text Memory 一次整理反思记录时允许生成的输出 token 上限；它不同于模型上下文长度，也不同于 WebShop 的动作步数。A1.1 保持输入记录和分组不变，只把已经失败的 repair 输出上限从 2048 提到 4096；3B 与 1.7B 的小模型诊断线仍然出现饱和，因此“单纯再给更多输出 token”被否定。', 'Here 2048 / 4096 is the Text Memory per-call output-token cap used while consolidating reflection records. It is neither model context length nor the WebShop action horizon. A1.1 kept the input records and grouping fixed and changed only the failed repair output cap from 2048 to 4096; both the 3B and 1.7B diagnostic lines still saturated, rejecting “just give the consolidator more output tokens.”')}</p>
    <div class="capacity-chain" aria-label={t('Text Memory 容量实验链', 'Text Memory capacity experiment chain')}>
      <div><strong>A1 · 2048</strong><p>{t('20 条记录的整理达到输出上限；同一批记录 repair 一次后仍可再次饱和。', 'Consolidating the 20 records can hit the output cap, and one repair pass on the same records can saturate again.')}</p></div><i>→</i>
      <div><strong>A1.1 · cap=4096 tokens</strong><p>{t('只把失败 repair 的输出上限翻倍，输入和分组不变；3B / 1.7B 仍然失败。', 'Only the failed repair output cap doubles; input and grouping stay fixed, and 3B / 1.7B still fail.')}</p></div><i>→</i>
      <div><strong>{t('第二种方案', 'Second plan')} · 20 records → 10+10</strong><p>{t('这里的 20 统计记录数，区别于 token 数：20 条 primary 与同 20 条 repair 都饱和时才固定拆成 10+10，随后压缩并回并；最大分裂深度 1。', 'Here 20 counts records and is separate from tokens: only after the 20-item primary and the same 20-item repair both saturate do we split deterministically into 10+10, compress, and merge; max split depth is one.')}</p></div>
    </div>
    <p>{t('这里的科学含义是容量失败的解释发生了变化；它没有声称“10+10 一定让最终分数更高”：单纯扩大容器不够，需要结构化、有限的分解。', 'The scientific claim is that the capacity-failure diagnosis changed. It does not claim that 10+10 necessarily raises the final benchmark score: a larger container alone was insufficient, so the successor uses structured, bounded decomposition.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>{t('4. TaskVector：从 SD-LoRA 更新到真实参数方向', '4. TaskVector: from SD-LoRA updates to a real parameter direction')}</h2>
    <p>{t('每个 SD-LoRA 组件都对应真实权重空间中的一个 ΔW。相邻且不同的状态 R27 与 R49 定义方向：', 'Each SD-LoRA component corresponds to a real ΔW in weight space. Adjacent distinct states R27 and R49 define the direction:')}</p>
    <div class="equation">τ = ΔW<sub>R49</sub> − ΔW<sub>R27</sub> = Σ<sub>i</sub> δc<sub>i</sub>B<sub>i</sub>A<sub>i</sub></div>
    <p>{t('为了不把 7 个系数的欧氏距离误当成真实权重距离，我们使用组件之间的 Gram 矩阵 G：', 'To avoid treating Euclidean distance between seven coefficients as the true weight-space distance, we use the component Gram matrix G:')}</p>
    <div class="equation">‖τ‖<sub>F</sub> = √(δcᵀGδc) = 0.6082257746</div>
    <p class="source"><a href={taskVectorPr358} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={taskVectorPr358} /> PR #358 · R14 / R27 / R49 与 Frobenius 几何证据</a></p>
    <p>{t('另一条参数分析线把这些方向放进更完整的 measurement pack：精确组件 Gram 重建、TaskVector cross-check、参数谱 / stable rank、principal parameter themes，以及 GPU replay-only causal ablation。它读取已经接受的参数状态，不回放正式训练，也不打开 final panel。', 'A separate parameter-analysis line places these directions in a fuller measurement pack: exact component-Gram reconstruction, TaskVector cross-checks, parameter spectra / stable rank, principal parameter themes, and GPU replay-only causal ablations. It reads accepted parameter states without replaying formal training or opening the final panel.')}</p>
    <p class="source"><a href={parameterMeasurementPr317} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={parameterMeasurementPr317} /> PR #317 · {t('参数 measurement pack 与机制分析', 'parameter measurement pack and mechanism analysis')}</a></p>
    <p>{t('基底包含 7 个 rank-8 SD-LoRA 组件。干预使用 λ∈{−1,0,0.5,1} 的有符号剂量，并加入 3 个与 τ 同 Frobenius 范数的随机方向。这样可以区分“这个方向有用”和“只要参数动得够多就会变”。', 'The basis contains seven rank-8 SD-LoRA components. Interventions use signed doses λ∈{−1,0,0.5,1} and three random directions with the same Frobenius norm as τ. This separates a direction-specific effect from generic parameter movement.')}</p>
    <div class="equation">θ′(λ) = θ<sub>R14</sub> + λτ</div>
    <p>{t('最多 9 组条件 × 64 个配对任务 = 576 条闭环轨迹。只有 +1.0τ 比三个同范数随机对照的中位数至少高 1.0 Task Score，同时完整成功不下降，才进入后续 1,536 条轨迹实验。', 'The cap is 9 conditions × 64 paired tasks = 576 closed-loop episodes. The follow-up 1,536-rollout experiment unlocks only if +1.0τ beats the median of the three norm-matched random controls by at least 1.0 Task Score without degrading exact success.')}</p>
    <aside><strong>{t('为什么曾经得到 τ=0？', 'Why did τ once equal zero?')}</strong><p>{t('早期把 75% 和 100% 当作两个锚点，但它们实际上都落到 R49。我们把这判为“不可识别”；“因果效果为零”不能从这里推出。随后改成真实不同的 R14 / R27 / R49。', 'The early 75% and 100% anchors both resolved to R49. We classified this as unidentifiable; a causal-null conclusion cannot be drawn from it. We then rebuilt the design around genuinely distinct R14 / R27 / R49 states.')}</p></aside>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>{t('5. Gated Delta Rule 与 DirectApply 到底只差什么', '5. What exactly differs between Gated Delta Rule and DirectApply')}</h2>
    <p>{t('两条路线都会先训练出同类 SD-LoRA 候选 Δt。GDR = Gated Delta Rule：候选训练完成后，再跑固定的 16-task 短期 probe，由 task-score acceptance 决定接受或拒绝。', 'Both routes first train the same kind of SD-LoRA candidate Δt. GDR = Gated Delta Rule: after candidate training, a fixed 16-task short probe runs and task-score acceptance decides whether to accept or reject the candidate.')}</p>
    <div class="equation piecewise">θ<sub>t+1</sub> = θ<sub>t</sub> + Δ<sub>t</sub> &nbsp; {t('若接受', 'if accepted')}<br />θ<sub>t+1</sub> = θ<sub>t</sub> &nbsp; {t('若拒绝', 'if rejected')}</div>
    <p>{t('DirectApply 保留共同的数据合同、工程安全、determinism 与 SD-LoRA 训练条件；候选通过这些共同合同后直接进入后续模型，16-task task-score probe 不再拥有接受 / 拒绝决定权。1.7B 的 44 个候选中只有 7 个被 GDR 接受，因此这个准入差异可能改变长期学习轨迹。', 'DirectApply keeps the shared data contracts, engineering safety, determinism, and SD-LoRA training conditions. Once a candidate passes those shared contracts, it enters the next state directly; the 16-task task-score probe no longer has accept/reject authority. GDR admitted only 7 of 44 candidates in the 1.7B run, so this admission difference can change the long-term learning trajectory.')}</p>
    <p class="source"><a href={q17} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={q17} /> GDR / DirectApply diagnostic lineage</a></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>{t('6. 严谨性与复现：为什么这些细节放在这里', '6. Rigor and reproducibility')}</h2>
    <p>{t('这些证据属于实验成立的前提；演讲主线只保留会改变科研判断的部分。只有当它们改变“这个结果还能不能解释”时，才需要回到主汇报。', 'These checks are prerequisites for a valid experiment. The main talk keeps only the parts that change the research judgment. They return to the main narrative only when they change whether the result is interpretable.')}</p>
    <details>
      <summary>{t('为什么旧 Q17 不继续原地修改', 'Why the old Q17 experiment was not modified in place')}</summary>
      <p>{t('旧双组实验原本冻结为“只差 GDR”。如果中途把其中一组改成 DirectApply-only，后面的差异就回答了另一个问题。因此旧证据保留为诊断，新 DirectApply 从同一个冻结起点建立独立实验身份。', 'The old twin was frozen around one difference: GDR. Switching an arm to DirectApply-only in place would make later results answer a different question. The old evidence remains diagnostic, and the fresh DirectApply experiment starts from the same frozen state under a separate identity.')}</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>{t('固定 GPU 重复性与参数哈希', 'Fixed-GPU repeatability and parameter hashes')}</summary>
